{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005550/extras/7ebdd3ac455a4b9eb5c8b043b0589a3a.avif?t=1763385503\" width=1078 height=544 /></span><strong>Fokkland</strong> is a cozy exploration game.<br>You play as <strong>Mara</strong>, the princess of a tiny realm filled with cute woodland animals. Wander freely, <strong>ride your horse</strong>, invite animals to <strong>follow</strong> you, help your friends\u2026 and keep an eye out for <strong>traps</strong>, <strong>goblins</strong>, and <strong>trolls</strong> along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fokkland isn\u2019t only gentle and sweet: <strong>you decide</strong> who Mara truly is.<br>Will you remain a kind princess\u2026 or let <strong>a darker side</strong> surface? Your choices shape the mood of the world and how it responds to you.<br><i>Some of Fokkland\u2019s truths are seen only by those who embrace Mara\u2019s true nature.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playable now (Beta)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-roam exploration &amp; horseback riding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal companions that can follow you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light stealth and danger management (traps, goblins, trolls)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap (community-driven)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castle housing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest system</strong> and <strong>combat</strong> (potential additions)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QoL improvements and new secrets to uncover</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Status</strong>: <strong>Beta</strong> \u2014 the game will grow with player feedback.<br><strong>Goal</strong>: A relaxing, all-ages experience with hidden paths for those who choose a darker destiny.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005550?t=1763385503","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005550/32a49d21da4db9abd748bf9459496164e798741e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763385503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005550/b5a82fcf780d1b8f6177c5d37460e2aab486b3db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763385503","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005550/b5a82fcf780d1b8f6177c5d37460e2aab486b3db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763385503","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005550/extras/7ebdd3ac455a4b9eb5c8b043b0589a3a.avif?t=1763385503\" width=1078 height=544 /></span><strong>Fokkland</strong> is a cozy exploration game.<br>You play as <strong>Mara</strong>, the princess of a tiny realm filled with cute woodland animals. Wander freely, <strong>ride your horse</strong>, invite animals to <strong>follow</strong> you, help your friends\u2026 and keep an eye out for <strong>traps</strong>, <strong>goblins</strong>, and <strong>trolls</strong> along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fokkland isn\u2019t only gentle and sweet: <strong>you decide</strong> who Mara truly is.<br>Will you remain a kind princess\u2026 or let <strong>a darker side</strong> surface? Your choices shape the mood of the world and how it responds to you.<br><i>Some of Fokkland\u2019s truths are seen only by those who embrace Mara\u2019s true nature.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playable now (Beta)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\